(7215899, 1112433, 174999, '<td valign="top">I so love this, to me its intriguing. However you ended up with that little butterfly as the shadow is amazing and the butterfly makes this picture the more interesting. I love how you can see the details in the veins of these leaves.. I expect this one will be placed high</td>', 'I so love this, to me its intriguing. However you ended up with that little butterfly as the shadow is amazing and the butterfly makes this picture the more interesting. I love how you can see the details in the veins of these leaves.. I expect this one will be placed high', '2014-05-12 15:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7215901, 1112411, 174999, '<td valign="top">I could never imagining trying to capture one of these to take its picture..... but I think this is the exception..flies are not pretty... the details in the wings and the background make this powerful, just wow!</td>', 'I could never imagining trying to capture one of these to take its picture..... but I think this is the exception..flies are not pretty... the details in the wings and the background make this powerful, just wow!', '2014-05-12 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
