(7216091, 1112166, 156466, '<td valign="top">Makes me wonder if you did the eggs too??</td>', 'Makes me wonder if you did the eggs too??', '2014-05-13 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216092, 1112434, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it needs to be properly centered.  Just a hair too much space to the left.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it needs to be properly centered.  Just a hair too much space to the left.', '2014-05-13 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216093, 1112360, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''d say you need a better beer, but you actually need better alignment on the caps.  Nice otherwise.</td>', 'I''d say you need a better beer, but you actually need better alignment on the caps.  Nice otherwise.', '2014-05-13 10:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216094, 1112245, 156466, '<td valign="top">You need to roll this to the right a couple degrees.  Otherwise nice.</td>', 'You need to roll this to the right a couple degrees.  Otherwise nice.', '2014-05-13 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216096, 1112459, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like how his head lines up with the center gap, but the rest of the lines are off because you need to be a tick to the right.  I know - wish you could have it both ways.</td>', 'I like how his head lines up with the center gap, but the rest of the lines are off because you need to be a tick to the right.  I know - wish you could have it both ways.', '2014-05-13 11:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216098, 1112418, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really digging this.  Nice!!</td>', 'Really digging this.  Nice!!', '2014-05-13 11:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216440, 1112166, 60581, '<td valign="top">I see this on top!</td>', 'I see this on top!', '2014-05-14 08:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216441, 1112459, 60581, '<td valign="top">To me it is a bit dark as well as the man standing in middle is break the symmetry.</td>', 'To me it is a bit dark as well as the man standing in middle is break the symmetry.', '2014-05-14 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216443, 1112476, 60581, '<td valign="top">It seems like focus went up on other side of the folks. I believe it would have come out better if the folks were in focus.</td>', 'It seems like focus went up on other side of the folks. I believe it would have come out better if the folks were in focus.', '2014-05-14 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216549, 1112371, 173844, '<td valign="top">The very lushness of the sky in this image is what fills me with awe (the word ''awesome'' having become so dilute as to no longer convey real meaning).  Then there''s a double symmetry to the two seeming daggers of land, with each other and with their own reflections.  Lastly, and poignantly, is the foreground with its panorama of delicate foliage.  A co-favorite.</td>', 'The very lushness of the sky in this image is what fills me with awe (the word ''awesome'' having become so dilute as to no longer convey real meaning).  Then there''s a double symmetry to the two seeming daggers of land, with each other and with their own reflections.  Lastly, and poignantly, is the foreground with its panorama of delicate foliage.  A co-favorite.', '2014-05-14 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216557, 1111943, 173844, '<td valign="top">An image of trees reflected in water isn''t novel, but the beautiful treatment of it here lifts it into art.  It''s the luminescence of the scene that first absorbs the viewer.  It''s both ghostly and serene.  The black and white treatment brings out the overall softness of this photo, makes the trees uniform in appearance and lends a fur-like texture to the brush.  Lastly, there''s the pleasure of peering into both the forest and its reflection as the trees recede into the darkness. A co-favorite.</td>', 'An image of trees reflected in water isn''t novel, but the beautiful treatment of it here lifts it into art.  It''s the luminescence of the scene that first absorbs the viewer.  It''s both ghostly and serene.  The black and white treatment brings out the overall softness of this photo, makes the trees uniform in appearance and lends a fur-like texture to the brush.  Lastly, there''s the pleasure of peering into both the forest and its reflection as the trees recede into the darkness. A co-favorite.', '2014-05-14 12:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216560, 1112411, 173844, '<td valign="top">The head on pose of this dragonfly is truly imposing and unusual.  It offers an entirely new understanding (at least for me) of an incredible insect.  The detail and depth of focus are terrific.  And, oh yeah, it''s fabulously symmetrical.</td>', 'The head on pose of this dragonfly is truly imposing and unusual.  It offers an entirely new understanding (at least for me) of an incredible insect.  The detail and depth of focus are terrific.  And, oh yeah, it''s fabulously symmetrical.', '2014-05-14 12:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216564, 1112352, 173844, '<td valign="top">Before I figured out the vertical perspective of this image it was a visual wonderland that I marveled at but could not figure out.  But it still retains a sense of fantasy once it''s righted.  A fun, impressive photograph.</td>', 'Before I figured out the vertical perspective of this image it was a visual wonderland that I marveled at but could not figure out.  But it still retains a sense of fantasy once it''s righted.  A fun, impressive photograph.', '2014-05-14 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216569, 1112433, 173844, '<td valign="top">The butterfly on the far side of this highlighted leaf is like a subdued gem or cameo.  Look closely and we see the subtle shades of pattern.  For the purpose of symmetry the butterfly is perfectly positioned.  Lovely.</td>', 'The butterfly on the far side of this highlighted leaf is like a subdued gem or cameo.  Look closely and we see the subtle shades of pattern.  For the purpose of symmetry the butterfly is perfectly positioned.  Lovely.', '2014-05-14 13:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216627, 1112396, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t say anything that would add to the beauty of this owl.  The focus and detail are so good that you can discern the details of the purple rings about his eyes.  As his back blurs it blends into the creamy background bokeh.</td>', 'Can''t say anything that would add to the beauty of this owl.  The focus and detail are so good that you can discern the details of the purple rings about his eyes.  As his back blurs it blends into the creamy background bokeh.', '2014-05-14 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216631, 1112409, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome bighorn sheep (?) in front on pose offers his healthy symmetry to the harem.  The rings on his horns and the patterns of his facial fur add nuance to the symmetry, though, as an aside, his eyes look a bit off.  A very nice portrait.</td>', 'Handsome bighorn sheep (?) in front on pose offers his healthy symmetry to the harem.  The rings on his horns and the patterns of his facial fur add nuance to the symmetry, though, as an aside, his eyes look a bit off.  A very nice portrait.', '2014-05-14 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216669, 1112080, 173844, '<td valign="top">A casual, offhanded nod to symmetry in the midst of everyday life.  The wheel barrow''s handles/legs shyly peek out from behind the load.  A biker happens by.  The image is well and pleasingly balanced in tone and composition.  Impressionistic.  Satisfying.</td>', 'A casual, offhanded nod to symmetry in the midst of everyday life.  The wheel barrow''s handles/legs shyly peek out from behind the load.  A biker happens by.  The image is well and pleasingly balanced in tone and composition.  Impressionistic.  Satisfying.', '2014-05-14 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216671, 1112427, 173844, '<td valign="top">Crisp, colorful image.  Symmetry in motion.  The smudge of the moon gives balance, depth and interest to the picture.</td>', 'Crisp, colorful image.  Symmetry in motion.  The smudge of the moon gives balance, depth and interest to the picture.', '2014-05-14 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216676, 1112244, 173844, '<td valign="top">The central terrain seems to be floating in the sky, like Brigadoon.  Its colors are warm and harmonious, except for that bit of bright red on the far shore.  The foreground is a bouquet of flowers and greenery.  Nice.</td>', 'The central terrain seems to be floating in the sky, like Brigadoon.  Its colors are warm and harmonious, except for that bit of bright red on the far shore.  The foreground is a bouquet of flowers and greenery.  Nice.', '2014-05-14 16:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216679, 1112463, 173844, '<td valign="top">The discrete lines of bank, rocks, leaves and lawn, and their reflection, make an interesting horizontal stripe that becomes even more graphically striking when viewed from a distance.  I like it.</td>', 'The discrete lines of bank, rocks, leaves and lawn, and their reflection, make an interesting horizontal stripe that becomes even more graphically striking when viewed from a distance.  I like it.', '2014-05-14 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216680, 1112327, 173844, '<td valign="top">The bird''s ponderously graceful take-off, and its gauzy reflection, appear within a somewhat dream-like, light blue setting.  As the moment unfolds the bird disappears upward out of the frame, and its reflection glides across the water, likewise disappearing.  That''s the continuing charm of the image.</td>', 'The bird''s ponderously graceful take-off, and its gauzy reflection, appear within a somewhat dream-like, light blue setting.  As the moment unfolds the bird disappears upward out of the frame, and its reflection glides across the water, likewise disappearing.  That''s the continuing charm of the image.', '2014-05-14 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7216882, 1112082, 172889, '<td valign="top">Nice find. I like the blending of shadows against the stairs and platforms</td>', 'Nice find. I like the blending of shadows against the stairs and platforms', '2014-05-15 04:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217000, 1112425, 173844, '<td valign="top">This could well be located in Area 51, a silhouetted alien spaceship, keenly symmetrical.  It''s a wonderful surprise in this wide open landscape.  The sky is dramatic but seems over-processed for my taste (which, of course, is merely incidental).  I like the complex simplicity of it.</td>', 'This could well be located in Area 51, a silhouetted alien spaceship, keenly symmetrical.  It''s a wonderful surprise in this wide open landscape.  The sky is dramatic but seems over-processed for my taste (which, of course, is merely incidental).  I like the complex simplicity of it.', '2014-05-15 11:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217084, 1112082, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fire escapes are inherently picturesque, all spidery symmetry and intricate shadows.  This is a very nice study, sensitively rendered in monotone.  The brickwork shines through and we even get hints of the apartments within.  So several layers of symmetry are pleasingly presented.</td>', 'Fire escapes are inherently picturesque, all spidery symmetry and intricate shadows.  This is a very nice study, sensitively rendered in monotone.  The brickwork shines through and we even get hints of the apartments within.  So several layers of symmetry are pleasingly presented.', '2014-05-15 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217087, 1112475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s charmingly symmetrical, but what I most appreciate here is the pastel, old-fashioned feel.  The slightly threatening atmosphere adds to a mood that I can''t quite put my finger on.  Nostalgia?  Fairy tale illusion of innocent times?  Gothic foreboding?  Anyway, I''m enjoying lingering over it.</td>', 'Yes, it''s charmingly symmetrical, but what I most appreciate here is the pastel, old-fashioned feel.  The slightly threatening atmosphere adds to a mood that I can''t quite put my finger on.  Nostalgia?  Fairy tale illusion of innocent times?  Gothic foreboding?  Anyway, I''m enjoying lingering over it.', '2014-05-15 14:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217097, 1112422, 173844, '<td valign="top">Intimate and endearing.  Their looks are so direct.  A lovely moment and an honor to be there to photograph it.  Unlike a bird guide, this speaks volumes.  Thank you for sharing this beautiful shot.</td>', 'Intimate and endearing.  Their looks are so direct.  A lovely moment and an honor to be there to photograph it.  Unlike a bird guide, this speaks volumes.  Thank you for sharing this beautiful shot.', '2014-05-15 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217099, 1112122, 108580, '<td valign="top">Shotgun shell ;) Reasonably symmetrical so DMC.</td>', 'Shotgun shell ;) Reasonably symmetrical so DMC.', '2014-05-15 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217102, 1112434, 108580, '<td valign="top">My top pick. I''ve seen this before. Yo-Spiff? Tx?</td>', 'My top pick. I''ve seen this before. Yo-Spiff? Tx?', '2014-05-15 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217108, 1112479, 150277, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  There are two bits of blur on petals at 6 pm and 9 pm that were just a tiny bit distracting.  But wonderful, strong colors.</td>', 'Lovely.  There are two bits of blur on petals at 6 pm and 9 pm that were just a tiny bit distracting.  But wonderful, strong colors.', '2014-05-15 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217113, 1112352, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully interesting symmetry.</td>', 'Wonderfully interesting symmetry.', '2014-05-15 14:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217114, 1112475, 150277, '<td valign="top">Pretty image - can''t believe how symmetrical the house is.</td>', 'Pretty image - can''t believe how symmetrical the house is.', '2014-05-15 14:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217115, 1112448, 150277, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I am seeing the symmetry in this photo.</td>', 'I am not sure I am seeing the symmetry in this photo.', '2014-05-15 14:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217116, 1112418, 150277, '<td valign="top">This is very striking.  I love how the center sharpness fades to a lovely blur.</td>', 'This is very striking.  I love how the center sharpness fades to a lovely blur.', '2014-05-15 14:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217117, 1112436, 150277, '<td valign="top">Powerful.</td>', 'Powerful.', '2014-05-15 14:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217119, 1112323, 150277, '<td valign="top">Quite a find.  The grunge/rough/dark background detracts a bit from the beauty for me.</td>', 'Quite a find.  The grunge/rough/dark background detracts a bit from the beauty for me.', '2014-05-15 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217121, 1112411, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharpness right where you need it.  Great image.</td>', 'Wonderful sharpness right where you need it.  Great image.', '2014-05-15 14:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217123, 1112064, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  The left string not begin straight bugged me a tad, since everything else was so symmetrical.</td>', 'Great catch.  The left string not begin straight bugged me a tad, since everything else was so symmetrical.', '2014-05-15 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217125, 1112369, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great, unique take.  Lovely execution. I really like that slight reflection.</td>', 'Great, unique take.  Lovely execution. I really like that slight reflection.', '2014-05-15 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217126, 1111943, 150277, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  I love the monochrome and sort of low key feel to the photo.  My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Cool image.  I love the monochrome and sort of low key feel to the photo.  My favorite of the challenge.', '2014-05-15 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
