(7217974, 1112365, 100831, '<td valign="top">At first glance, everything seems so wrong but then those stars are so right. Ultimately, it leaves me wanting to take in every detail.. I keep looking. The curve on the wall..that little hand. I''ve come back to this so many times.... ah.</td>', 'At first glance, everything seems so wrong but then those stars are so right. Ultimately, it leaves me wanting to take in every detail.. I keep looking. The curve on the wall..that little hand. I''ve come back to this so many times.... ah.', '2014-05-18 12:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217984, 1112464, 67258, '<td valign="top">A decent photo of a black-headed gull, and harder to get than it may look,but I do wish this was in colour.  Whilst your conversion has managed to keep detail in the face, which is good, there isn''t a sufficient tonal range across the photo to keep my interest.  There is little textural detail, and somehow this seems more noticable in mono.</td>', 'A decent photo of a black-headed gull, and harder to get than it may look,but I do wish this was in colour.  Whilst your conversion has managed to keep detail in the face, which is good, there isn''t a sufficient tonal range across the photo to keep my interest.  There is little textural detail, and somehow this seems more noticable in mono.', '2014-05-18 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7218003, 1112423, 152252, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Great lighting. For some reason makes me think of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a>''s work.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Great lighting. For some reason makes me think of  Neat''s work.', '2014-05-18 15:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7218004, 1112225, 152252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2014-05-18 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
