(7218554, 1112080, 150277, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling there had to be something special about this shot, but my brain just could not decipher what it was.  I''m still not entirely sure I understand the association to symmetry.  It might have worked better for me had the top half of the person been cut-off and I had only seen the wheelbarrow and the bicycle tires.  (But I''m guessing that wasn''t your vision).  Sorry I couldn''t see it.  Maybe provide details on what you were going for?</td>', 'I had a feeling there had to be something special about this shot, but my brain just could not decipher what it was.  I''m still not entirely sure I understand the association to symmetry.  It might have worked better for me had the top half of the person been cut-off and I had only seen the wheelbarrow and the bicycle tires.  (But I''m guessing that wasn''t your vision).  Sorry I couldn''t see it.  Maybe provide details on what you were going for?', '2014-05-19 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
