(7218855, 1112411, 129807, '<td valign="top">I just freaking LOVE this! The detail is unreal. Any chance you could show the originals so I can understand where your focus points were and how much the rest was oof? I''m getting really interested in focus stacking and stuff along those lines but I still have no idea how to do it effectively. Did I mention I really like this shot? Congrats on the more than well deserved ribbon too. :D<br/> <br/>eta: and congrats on the new PB! Awesome!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-05-20 19:16:13.</i></td>', 'I just freaking LOVE this! The detail is unreal. Any chance you could show the originals so I can understand where your focus points were and how much the rest was oof? I''m getting really interested in focus stacking and stuff along those lines but I still have no idea how to do it effectively. Did I mention I really like this shot? Congrats on the more than well deserved ribbon too. :D eta: and congrats on the new PB! Awesome!', '2014-05-20 20:13:15.000000', '2014-05-20 20:16:13.000000', 0),
